6189..6265 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6266..6340 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6341..6417 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6418..6492 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6493..6501 Comment "/// `g`."
